<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Romatex yr shr nil.</title>
<headline>Romatex yr shr nil.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)    0.0	   vs 113.6</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)	 0.0	   making 4.0 vs 43.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.0	   vs 27.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.1	   vs 34.4</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.1	   vs 7.4</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.5	   vs 1.8 received</p>
<p>    Turnover		505.3	   vs 517.8</p>
<p>Full name: Romatex Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional item	0.0	   vs 1.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The group blamed its poor results on illegal imports, lower demand and sharp raw material price increases. But market conditions were expected to improve and steps were being taken to become more internationally competitive. These should result in some improvements in earnings for 1996/97.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 23 2258</p>
</text>
